into Abel's identity gives\n\n$$\n{W}^{′}(x)=-3W(x).\n$$\n\nNow, we solve the first-order differential equation for $W:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{W}^{′} & =-3W \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}W}{W} & =-3\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{\\text{d}W}{W} & =\\int -3\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|W| & =-3x+K \\\\ |W| & ={e}^{K}{e}^{-3x} \\\\ W & =C{e}^{-3x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is a constant.\n\nNext, we use the given value $W(0)=0$ to find $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}W(0) & =C{e}^{-3\\cdot 0} \\\\ 0 & =C\\cdot 1 \\\\ C & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have $W(x)=0\\text{ for all }x\\in R.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186497400 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6045d0f1-c5e0-5e88-bf41-e0009edfbbd3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4Q(x)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496871} {:answer/id #uuid "687d92b4-4caa-5fc9-8d37-63128a791d4a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496886} {:answer/id #uuid "a5c43a76-f128-5b7f-b097-5c194030e9ac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4Q(x)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186497001} {:answer/id #uuid "efe3a6a0-86d9-5479-a4e0-cddc9da1b298" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186497174}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "687d92b4-4caa-5fc9-8d37-63128a791d4a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496886} :answer-field/id #uuid "5a400ebe-05b9-5fea-bc00-c6c0440a2abc" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186497257} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "24395af1-9df4-5644-be8d-db6adebee26d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C{e}^{-4x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496734} {:answer/id #uuid "3c757474-ae67-5a54-adba-2dc1da22dd83" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C{x}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496787} {:answer/id #uuid "595167da-3acd-5df3-b394-03c41a45bf79" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C{e}^{4x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496849} {:answer/id #uuid "ad2a0096-910d-5190-b55c-8f4b28f4a232" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "Cx" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186497011}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "595167da-3acd-5df3-b394-03c41a45bf79" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C{e}^{4x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496849} :answer-field/id #uuid "7dfca232-36a7-5cb3-b430-c23b013e76fb" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186497278} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "41652d46-4e1b-554c-b2f6-2fa3e1ff95c2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$W(x)\\ne 0$ for all $x\\in R$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496799} {:answer/id #uuid "6186a245-0035-5550-a011-2d8886fe37b9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$W(x)=0$ for all $x\\in R$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496872} {:answer/id #uuid "7a9676d0-911f-5862-8941-5a14f3882472" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$W(x)=0$ for some but not all $x\\in R$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496915}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6186a245-0035-5550-a011-2d8886fe37b9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$W(x)=0$ for all $x\\in R$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496872} :answer-field/id #uuid "966a0e85-1502-5c94-9acf-996294f09b8b" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186497288}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "c5f06778-8fd3-5821-8bf0-21b9cd17fe6a" :question/math-academy-id "q-343296" :question/problem "$$\n{y}^{″}-4{y}^{′}+Q(x)y=0\n$$\n\nLet ${y}_{1}$ and ${y}_{2}$ be solutions to the second-order homogeneous differential equation above, where $Q(x)$ is continuous on $(-\\infty ,\\infty ).$ The Wronskian satisfies $W(2)=0.$ Select the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\nThe Wronskian $W(x)$ satisfies the following first-order differential equation:\n\n$$\n{W}^{′}(x)={{field-1}}W(x)\n$$\n\nSolving this equation, we get\n\n$$\nW={{field-2}}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\n\nNow, using the fact that $W(2)=0,$ we obtain \n{{field-3}}." :question/worked-solution "The separated calculation below treats $W\\ne0$. The solution $W\\equiv0$ must also be included; allowing $C=0$ in the final formula supplies it.\n\nAbel's identity says that if ${y}_{1}$ and ${y}_{2}$ are solutions of\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+P(x){y}^{′}+Q(x)y=0,\n$$\n\nthen their Wronskian $W(x)$ satisfies\n\n$$\n{W}^{′}(x)=-P(x)W(x).\n$$\n\nIn our equation, the coefficient of ${y}^{′}$ is \n\n$$\nP(x)=-4.\n$$\n\nSubstituting into Abel's identity gives\n\n$$\n{W}^{′}(x)=4W(x).\n$$\n\nNow, we solve the first-order differential equation for $W:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{W}^{′} & =4W \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}W}{W} & =4\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{\\text{d}W}{W} & =\\int 4\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|W| & =4x+K \\\\ |W| & ={e}^{K}{e}^{4x} \\\\ W & =C{e}^{4x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is a constant.\n\nNext, we use the given value $W(2)=0$ to find $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}W(2) & =C{e}^{4\\cdot 2} \\\\ 0 & =C{e}^{8} \\\\ C & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have $W(x)=0\\text{ for all }x\\in R.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186497407 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "138c7775-7211-5916-a88f-f34085f4e58d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "Cx" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496702} {:answer/id #uuid "16dd2faf-97cd-5227-a69c-a24ad399df7c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C{e}^{-x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496707} {:answer/id #uuid "47985eb4-2da3-590b-9c9f-debdadc43135" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C{e}^{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496816} {:answer/id #uuid "d43c47fe-8dfe-5ab2-bf30-ae9c8091017a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C{x}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186497101}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "16dd2faf-97cd-5227-a69c-a24ad399df7c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C{e}^{-x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496707} :answer-field/id #uuid "6d6975b2-cd8f-53c8-a76b-cbe26c306432" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186497267} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "245b91f9-9a34-52df-a77c-4058508e007b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496736} {:answer/id #uuid "474d5070-8a51-5457-abf9-ed6cc2756bbe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-Q(x)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496815} {:answer/id #uuid "8560c96f-20c3-520c-986a-fd7e019bc228" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "Q(x)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496931} {:answer/id #uuid "eb0b0604-9f0c-542a-81b6-26a61592aa98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186497161}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "245b91f9-9a34-52df-a77c-4058508e007b" :answer/type {:d